<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-23T15:05:04.863Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:05:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels continue advancing in eastern DRC, seizing towns and planning a housing project in Goma, while ADF gunmen keep killing civilians in Ituri. Fighting near a hospital in Ituri has trapped a WHO Ebola response team for over 24 hours, forcing staff to shelter in a maternity ward and prompting WHO to call for evacuation. South African mercenaries have been captured in eastern DRC, and Kenya and the DRC presidents have agreed to restore diplomatic ties after a meeting in Brazzaville. 1,158 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFA5MW0wUk4wZnhJbjdGUDI5b1A4VVIta3NpemZ3S0ZwY3pnYXVQcGtpd1AtQVhyM3pzaVZVRGgyeGUtaUlFYkVLa18wZW1zbUhJNkpoWFllWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPNTh6UEhmRFNqcUsxeUJFZDkxR2tkRVlDY3Q3akhsMHgzeXRVaHJRd09nMWpoTHpGVFBvdXMtUzByYllYajR1NHpPVElhalZzRmRTd0hHdnlUdmtkWU5EUUgzSS1XRzBxaVhzZ2hoSjBfQ3RyQnV5N1p0ckxSUHdOQmw1S1h4MWlLOE5PTUNHZFFKSkpLNGNkRnRn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mail &amp;amp; Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFA0TmxPR0c1TURnTGJRNDVnQUZxRi1TQTBxdFAwRE1yZnZaUVdOZm5yb2UxLU5yZDBRLUlPY29uZllScy1td1gyWFZGU0Z3TzJsY09PV3djYkZub1BpMVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;People Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOWGxtcFJFeXVSMzdvdXBES0VsRUtha0pLeElQZ1lvTE8zWjF0ZnJUWlFyQjNfY0JwYXJ2ekItTXZyU0VHR2dScVR4SmIySWIwQmoyRU1SUXZCbDVMZU0zYVBGSHZrZ1dKWVZHNTl3NkFSMzZYbHIzZTVseS01Yl9FU3A0bWJGbEY2dEFLMkIwR1ZOTXJBaThnSHUwaHVVWlp5V19z?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Tokyo Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirg